#X text 549 92 Step locks: with STEP WRITE on and a step selected (seq-writing) \, edits are written to the step but kept out of the audio (left spigot) \, and the GUI is sent the written value instead of the audible one \, which would pull the fader back. When writing ends \, a bang to [change -1] sends the audible value to the GUI again. Lock playback comes in on textseq \, so it is not gated.;
