#X text 521 211 record = record mode button -> activate/deactivate automation recording;
#X text 521 292 evolvetime = sets parameter evolve time;
#X text 521 246 evolve = evolve mode button -> allows the value to be evolved to to be set and prevents parameter from updating until evolve button has been released;
#X text 521 316 jump = jump mode button -> allows the value to be jumped to to be set and prevents parameter updating until jump button has been released;
#X text 521 386 clockin = receives a bang every beat from the master clock \, which is used to trigger the start of automation playback \, ensuring that playback always starts on a beat.;
#X text 521 467 tempo = controls the speed at which the automation is read. This does skip stored values if the tempo increases \, but interpolates values if decreased.;
#X text 521 513 reverse = reverse the read back of the automation;
